  "assertion_requirements": [
    "The source-shaped SSID state uses ipAssignmentMode Bridge mode and useVlanTagging true; defaultVlanId changes from 71 to 72 and later returns to 71.",
    "The VLAN field change is a configuration observation, not proof that the client moved VLAN, renewed DHCP, or changed address.",
    "Network audit is relevant only when its exact SSID relationship is verified; otherwise it is context only.",
    "A Block observation does not establish a successful backend handoff for that client by absence.",
    "The recovery claim requires the explicit later Allow and compatible handoff observation.",
    "Native FMC policy-edit and deployment evidence remain a blocked variant; do not emit synthetic FMC audit or deployment records.",
    "Cilium service settings are synthetic administrator configuration; routed VIP reachability is an explicit test precondition and provides no observed network-path evidence."
  ],
